source: crates/carta/tests/golden_writer.rs
expression: output
---
<anchor xml:id="lists" />
<para>
  A bullet list opens right after a paragraph line, with no blank
  between:
</para>
<itemizedlist spacing="compact">
  <listitem>
    <para>
      apples
    </para>
  </listitem>
  <listitem>
    <para>
      pears
    </para>
  </listitem>
</itemizedlist>
<para>
  An ordered list interrupts the same way:
</para>
<orderedlist spacing="compact">
  <listitem>
    <para>
      second
    </para>
  </listitem>
  <listitem>
    <para>
      third
    </para>
  </listitem>
</orderedlist>
<para>
  A parenthesized or roman marker has a list shape but no enabled style
  here, so it breaks off as its own plain paragraph rather than folding
  in:
</para>
<para>
  (5) parenthesized
</para>
<para>
  A decimal marker closed by a single paren stays prose and folds in, so
  these two lines remain one paragraph: 1) not a list 2) still prose
</para>
